'''Outpost Beta''',<ref name="BTC" /> or '''Beta Outpost''',<ref name="SWCL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> was a sentry station located near the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance's]] [[Echo Base]] on the [[planet]] [[Hoth]]. The outpost consisted of several [[1.4 FD P-Tower]]s, [[DF.9 anti-infantry battery|DF.9 Turrets]], and one [[v-150 Planet Defender]] with trenches over the area. During the [[Battle of Hoth]], [[Blue Squadron (Rebel Alliance)|Blue Squadron]] was assigned to defend the post,<ref name="SWB" /> and the outpost's [[troop]]s were commanded by [[Trey Callum]].<ref name="SWCL" /> Outpost Beta was the first to confirm the presence of [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] troops on the ground. The station was the first sentry base destroyed during the battle, after being annihilated in half a dozen [[laser]] blasts from an [[All Terrain Armored Transport]] [[walker]].<ref name="BTC" />

==Behind the scenes==
Outpost Beta was featured in ''[[Star Wars Battlefront]]'', a [[Star Wars video games|video game]] published by [[Electronic Arts]] on [[November 17]], [[2015]]. The map is available in three game modes: Walker Assault, Turning Point, and Supremacy.

